{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warlords rise. Empires fall. Your destiny is forged in the fires of conquest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ashen Destiny</i> is a turn-based strategy epic set in a war-torn land inspired by the <i>Romance of the Three Kingdoms</i> series \u2014 a love letter, if you will. Conquer randomized provinces, recruit powerful generals with random stats, and command armies of up to <strong>6,000 soldiers</strong> in massive tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two campaigns are ever the same!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff9 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Army Control</strong> \u2013 Command up to <strong>20 generals</strong> at once on beautiful battlefields, each with their own randomly generated stats and your chosen unit types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized World Maps with Different Sizes</strong> \u2013 Every campaign unfolds across a procedurally generated world filled with unpredictable opportunities and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/extras/532fdaa35ccebf711fc8067dc525ed7e.avif?t=1756248601\" width=900 height=520 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical 3D Battles</strong> \u2013 Engage in turn-based combat on a grid-based 3D battlefield. Use terrain, troop composition, and positioning to outmaneuver the enemy.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/extras/87380573a6fd1dc84e3822b9876883ea.avif?t=1756248601\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Province Management</strong> \u2013 Control resources like Soldiers, Crops, Food, Horses, Bows, and Arms. Train troops, reward generals, search for hidden talent, and expand your war machine with extra help from mining, trade, and a savvy traveling merchant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/extras/9d5c329032feca1837fdc77ab6730148.avif?t=1756248601\" width=170 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquest Through Strategy</strong> \u2013 Every decision matters. Strike with brute force, or outwit rivals through manipulation, diplomacy \u2014 or assassination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you conquer through loyalty or fear, battle or diplomacy, your legacy will be written in blood and ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your warlords await. Your rivals are watching. It\u2019s time to shape your Ashen Destiny.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867040?t=1756248601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/a715392215357ea30c78d8e6cd1871053cf3b78c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756248601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/9ecc84f9ee163cac53a7b1589cf912226e9e65bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756248601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/9ecc84f9ee163cac53a7b1589cf912226e9e65bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756248601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3929070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warlords rise. Empires fall. Your destiny is forged i