 troops, reward generals, search for hidden talent, and expand your war machine with extra help from mining, trade, and a savvy traveling merchant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/extras/9d5c329032feca1837fdc77ab6730148.avif?t=1756248601\" width=170 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquest Through Strategy</strong> \u2013 Every decision matters. Strike with brute force, or outwit rivals through manipulation, diplomacy \u2014 or assassination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you conquer through loyalty or fear, battle or diplomacy, your legacy will be written in blood and ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your warlords await. Your rivals are watching. It\u2019s time to shape your Ashen Destiny.</strong></p>","developers":["Arrow & Blade Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867040/1939eab2243ac95e67629c00a203706f0ffae8ca/header.jpg?t=1756248601","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257176018,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176018/movie480.mp4?t=1753927916","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176018/movie_max.mp4?t=1753927916"},"name":"Ashen Destiny Beta Trailer2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176018/e411ed147ea4